{"type":"message","id":"1430b4b7","parentId":"316b1acc","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:11:30.663Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vtbejg0ky0ui_3","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7d7b241d69b2643e776e3188db85102dc56ff53504cdd5529e72e9cf531fe60\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 100,\n      \"endLine\": 126,\n      \"score\": 0.784279647258985,\n      \"textScore\": 0.784279647258985,\n      \"snippet\": \"| 预订流程 | Sequential Workflow | 预订→排房→确认→发送通知 |\\n| 紧急投诉 | Handoff | 礼宾→值班经理→总经理升级 |\\n| 多维度数据分析 | Parallel + 聚合 | 竞品价格 + 出租率 + RevPAR 并行查询 |\\n| 客服质检 | Group Chat | AI评审团：多个Agent 评估同一服务案例 |\\n| 收益管理 | Magentic-One | Manager 动态分配：市场分析/定价/预测 |\\n\\n#### ✅ 技术层面的借鉴\\n\\n1. **YAML 声明式 Agent** — 德胧可将各酒店角色（前台AI、礼宾AI、财务AI）YAML化，易维护\\n2. **Checkpointing** — 长任务（如月报生成）中断恢复\\n3. **Human-in-the-loop** — 重要决策（折扣审批、投诉升级）需人工确认\\n4. **Memory 架构** — 客人历史偏好跨 Agent 共享（Redis/Foundry）\\n5. **MCP 协议** — 接入德胧 PMS、CRS、POS 等系统\\n\\n#### ⚠️ 需要注意的差异\\n\\n- 德胧已有 OpenClaw 架构，MAF 是 Python/.NET SDK，不直接替代\\n- MAF 适合构建\\\"应用内Agent\\\"，德胧需求是\\\"消息驱动的跨平台Agent\\\"\\n- 可考虑：**用 MAF 模式设计工作流，用 OpenClaw 执行**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 五、落地建议\\n\\n### 短期（1-3个月）：架构对齐\\n1. **升级认知** — 德胧AI伙伴了解 MAF 1.0 发布，A\\n\\nSource: memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L100-L126\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L100-L126\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0b010421084a2572958520ffb19a73f099c6c8bdbab2adc494ee26fedd056aea\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 118,\n      \"endLine\": 154,\n      \"score\": 0.7815705900565634,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7815705900565634,\n      \"snippet\": \"- 可考虑：**用 MAF 模式设计工作流，用 OpenClaw 执行**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 五、落地建议\\n\\n### 短期（1-3个月）：架构对齐\\n1. **升级认知** — 德胧AI伙伴了解 MAF 1.0 发布，AutoGen 已进入维护\\n2. **模式映射** — 将现有 AutoGen 工作流模式映射到 MAF 5种编排模式\\n3. **试点 YAML 声明式 Agent** — 在测试环境验证声明式配置的优势\\n\\n### 中期（3-6个月）：技术升级\\n1. **引入 Checkpointing** — 解决长任务中断问题\\n2. **接入 MCP** — 标准化德胧各系统的工具调用协议\\n3. **部署 DevUI** — 提升 Agent 调试效率\\n4. **参考 Magentic-One** — 设计收益管理 Manager Agent\\n\\n### 长期（6-12个月）：生态整合\\n1. **A2A 协议** — 与其他酒店集团 AI Agent 互通（行业标准）\\n2. **Azure AI Foundry** — 如德胧使用 Azure 可获得托管部署优势\\n3. **Memory 架构统一** — 客人360°视图跨 Agent 共享\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 六、风险与注意事项\\n\\n| 风险 | 评估 |\\n|------|------|\\n| AutoGen 废弃风险 | ⚠️ 高 — AutoGen 已进入维护，需尽快规划迁移 |\\n| 技术锁定风险 | ⚠️ 中 — MAF 与 Azure 生态绑定深，建议保留多框架能力 |\\n| 学习曲线 | ⚠️ 低 — Python API 与\\n\\nSource: memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L118-L154\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L118-L154\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"b7d7b241d69b2643e776e3188db85102dc56ff53504cdd5529e72e9cf531fe60","path":"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md","startLine":100,"endLine":126,"score":0.784279647258985,"textScore":0.784279647258985,"snippet":"| 预订流程 | Sequential Workflow | 预订→排房→确认→发送通知 |\n| 紧急投诉 | Handoff | 礼宾→值班经理→总经理升级 |\n| 多维度数据分析 | Parallel + 聚合 | 竞品价格 + 出租率 + RevPAR 并行查询 |\n| 客服质检 | Group Chat | AI评审团：多个Agent 评估同一服务案例 |\n| 收益管理 | Magentic-One | Manager 动态分配：市场分析/定价/预测 |\n\n#### ✅ 技术层面的借鉴\n\n1. **YAML 声明式 Agent** — 德胧可将各酒店角色（前台AI、礼宾AI、财务AI）YAML化，易维护\n2. **Checkpointing** — 长任务（如月报生成）中断恢复\n3. **Human-in-the-loop** — 重要决策（折扣审批、投诉升级）需人工确认\n4. **Memory 架构** — 客人历史偏好跨 Agent 共享（Redis/Foundry）\n5. **MCP 协议** — 接入德胧 PMS、CRS、POS 等系统\n\n#### ⚠️ 需要注意的差异\n\n- 德胧已有 OpenClaw 架构，MAF 是 Python/.NET SDK，不直接替代\n- MAF 适合构建\"应用内Agent\"，德胧需求是\"消息驱动的跨平台Agent\"\n- 可考虑：**用 MAF 模式设计工作流，用 OpenClaw 执行**\n\n---\n\n## 五、落地建议\n\n### 短期（1-3个月）：架构对齐\n1. **升级认知** — 德胧AI伙伴了解 MAF 1.0 发布，A\n\nSource: memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L100-L126","source":"memory","citation":"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L100-L126"},{"id":"0b010421084a2572958520ffb19a73f099c6c8bdbab2adc494ee26fedd056aea","path":"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md","startLine":118,"endLine":154,"score":0.7815705900565634,"textScore":0.7815705900565634,"snippet":"- 可考虑：**用 MAF 模式设计工作流，用 OpenClaw 执行**\n\n---\n\n## 五、落地建议\n\n### 短期（1-3个月）：架构对齐\n1. **升级认知** — 德胧AI伙伴了解 MAF 1.0 发布，AutoGen 已进入维护\n2. **模式映射** — 将现有 AutoGen 工作流模式映射到 MAF 5种编排模式\n3. **试点 YAML 声明式 Agent** — 在测试环境验证声明式配置的优势\n\n### 中期（3-6个月）：技术升级\n1. **引入 Checkpointing** — 解决长任务中断问题\n2. **接入 MCP** — 标准化德胧各系统的工具调用协议\n3. **部署 DevUI** — 提升 Agent 调试效率\n4. **参考 Magentic-One** — 设计收益管理 Manager Agent\n\n### 长期（6-12个月）：生态整合\n1. **A2A 协议** — 与其他酒店集团 AI Agent 互通（行业标准）\n2. **Azure AI Foundry** — 如德胧使用 Azure 可获得托管部署优势\n3. **Memory 架构统一** — 客人360°视图跨 Agent 共享\n\n---\n\n## 六、风险与注意事项\n\n| 风险 | 评估 |\n|------|------|\n| AutoGen 废弃风险 | ⚠️ 高 — AutoGen 已进入维护，需尽快规划迁移 |\n| 技术锁定风险 | ⚠️ 中 — MAF 与 Azure 生态绑定深，建议保留多框架能力 |\n| 学习曲线 | ⚠️ 低 — Python API 与\n\nSource: memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L118-L154","source":"memory","citation":"memory/MSA-MAF-Research-20260413.md#L118-L154"}],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode":"fts-only"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776247890662}}
{"type":"message","id":"9a041cd0","parentId":"1430b4b7","timestamp":"2026-04-15T10:12:00.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the data I need. Let me analyze:\n\n**任务看板 (ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd):**\nTotal: 25 tasks\n- 知识沉淀: Blocked-已阻塞 (小八)\n- 【小柱】统一知识资产管理体系v1.0部署: Done-已完成\n- 【workbuddy】全族权限开通+多子Agent: Done-已完成\n- 【Qclaw】MiniMax实时任务实践: Running-执行中\n- 【Qclaw】租户级权限开通: Running-执行中\n\n\n- 【小柱】建立子Agent架构: Dead-已超时\n- 【小柱】MiniMax模型能力分析与分配建议: Done-已完成\n- 【小云】三层存储架构部署 & 任务看板扩展: Done-已完成\n- 【各龙虾】历史知识沉淀追溯: Running-执行中\n- Plus 17 historical check records, many already marked as Dead\n\n**AI协作表 (Rr8Wb97XqaS8udsOAv0cXQjznUf):**\nTotal: 6 tasks\n- 5 待执行 + 1 进行中\n\nLooking at the Qclaw tasks specifically, both the MiniMax实时任务实践 and 租户级权限开通 have been in Running状态 since 1775779000000 (2026-04-07). I need to convert that timestamp to UTC—1775779 is the seconds portion, so I'm working with 1775779000, which should be around April 2026.\n\nLet me recalculate: from 1970 to 2026 is about 56 years, which accounts for roughly 1,766,784,000 seconds. That means 1775779000 seconds from epoch puts us in April 2026, with the 000 milliseconds confirming it's early April 7th. I'm converting millisecond timestamps to UTC dates. Since we're at 2026-04-15 10:11 UTC, I need to calculate what 1775779000 milliseconds represents—that's about 17.76 million seconds from the Unix epoch, which works out to roughly January 1970 plus 56 years and some months, landing around May 1970 in UTC.\n\nLet me recalculate more carefully by working backwards from the current timestamp of 1744686060000, which corresponds to April 2026, and figure out the exact date and time for the older timestamp. Now I'm checking the second task record which has a last heartbeat of 1744383060000, converting that to a date around March 2026. The Qclaw tasks and the sub-agent architecture work seem to be from early April, but I'm realizing the timestamp 1775779000 might actually be in seconds rather than milliseconds, which would put it much further in the future. So converting 1744686060 to UTC, I get April 15, 2026 at 02:11 AM—the same as the previous check, which makes sense since these are consecutive heartbeat checks. Now I'm working through 1744383060 to figure out what that timestamp represents.\n\nLooking at the task records, the Qclaw tasks from April 7 are still running with no updates, while the sub-agent architecture task from April 8 went dead after 60 minutes. The active tasks are just the scheduled checks happening every two hours.\n\nThe real issue is that the task records don't have a reliable last_updated field to properly detect timeouts. The AI collaboration table still shows six pending tasks for Xiao Miao, and I'm noticing the 0311 and 0611 check records are missing status information—I'll need to add those to get a complete picture of what's actually dead versus just inactive. Looking at the timestamp data, the last heartbeat recorded was at 06:11 UTC on April 15th with a value of 1744686060000 milliseconds, but the current time is 10:11 UTC—meaning this agent hasn't sent a heartbeat in about 4 hours. The check record itself shows no overdue minutes, suggesting the task completed normally before the gap started. So I'm tracking the pattern across these cron jobs—the last heartbeat was around 1744686060000 milliseconds, which converts to April 15, 2026 at 06:11 UTC. That means we're currently 4 hours past that point with no new heartbeats, so I need to update the timestamp to reflect the current time of 1744699860000 milliseconds and log this check as the new baseline. Looking at the active tasks across the boards, there are no new Dead tasks beyond the historical ones already recorded, and the current timestamp is 2026-04-15 10:11 UTC. I need to log this check-in at that time, then find the shared pool work progress database to document the status."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me find the shared pool progress database and update heartbeat.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_44ub9y9zr9jy_1","name":"feishu_search_doc_wiki","arguments":{"action":"search","query":"共享池 工作进度","page_size":10}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_44ub9y9zr9jy_2","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"心跳 state json 1744686060000"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776247890664,"responseId":"062e97529d634a68099cac0aa5fe2d2c"}}
